	"Description": "lần đầu tui tập làm mod, mọi người tải và chơi thử, nếu có lỗi nào thì góp ý và bình luận giúp tui để bản mod trở nên hoàn thiện hơn nhhan ,( rất cần những lời góp ý và chỉnh sửa của mọi người\u00A0\n<br />Bakugo Katsuki with more than 1500 lines choice dialogue, Each time you talk to Bakugo you will have the option to make choices that affect your level of affection. You can choose\u00A0flirt with him or tease him\u00A0or make him angry. His dialogues change according to affection, you should increase his affection slowly and gradually to fully enjoy all the dialogues. he only talks to you when he is moving and walking on the map and when he is not doing anything, don't talk to him when he is training or sleeping, otherwise he will just curse you all the time.This mod\u00A0will make you love him more and understand him more when talking with him everyday,\u00A0\u00A0is there any other hidden feelings behind that rude and grumpy appearance? Pls dowload it because he so cute i swear !! hope you will enjoy it !!\n<br />The mod is still updating ^^",
